<!--
  Joined apartment for a voice go-to that starts outside a room.
  Includes the frozen walk plant once, the same way each single-room
  scene does. The only floor geom is that plant plane (size 3 3,
  spanning -3..+3 m). Furniture bodies are copied unchanged into a
  mount frame, so positions relative to each room stay the same.
  West rooms (entrance, living) are yawed pi so their open side
  faces the hall. East rooms (bedroom, kitchen, bathroom) keep yaw 0.
  Openings in the hall walls are 0.90 m clear. No rug, mat, or
  threshold is placed in an opening or in the hall. Not a map.
-->
